    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0365" n="245" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg245"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Colombian Minister to Acting Secretary of State
                        Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Colombia</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-05-27"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The chargé d’affaires ad interim presents his compliments to the Assistant
                    Secretary of State in charge of the Department and has the honor to inclose a
                    copy of the address which Dr. Diego Mendoza will have the honor to deliver upon
                    his presentation to the President of the Republic.</p>


                <xi:include href="d255-a1.xml" xpointer="d255-a1"/>
